WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:05.520
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to&nbsp;
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is no longer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.760
allowed to interview new personnel!
There is a long and arduous interview&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.560
process when it comes to hiring new&nbsp;
research staff at the SCP Foundation.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.880
Dr. Bright was once allowed to conduct these&nbsp;
interviews, but after veering off-topic and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.680
asking interview questions that included "What's&nbsp;
your favorite scary movie?" "What's your star&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:28.800
sign? Because I don't work well with Geminis."&nbsp;
and "How much wood would a woodchuck chuck if a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:34.160
woodchuck could chuck wood?" he has officially&nbsp;
been barred from conducting future interviews.

